%H A099155 Walter D. Potter, Robert W. Robinson, John A. Miller, Krys J. Kochut, and D. Z. Redys, <a href="https://www.researchgate.net/publication/2577776">Using the Genetic Algorithm to Find Snake In The Box Codes</a>, Proc. 7th Int'l Conf. Ind'l Engin. Appl. Artif. Intel. Expert Sys. (Austin, Texas, 1994), 421-426.
