%e A099155 a(3)=4: Path of a longest 3-snake starts at 000 and then visits 100 101 111 011.
%e A099155 a(4)=7: Path of a longest 4-snake: 0000 1000 1010 1110 0110 0111 0101 1101.
%e A099155 See figures 1 and 2 in Rajan-Shende.
